[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2625620990","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102206#issuecomment-2625620990","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102206","id":2625620990,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cf8v-","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-30T21:21:12Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T21:21:12Z","body":"CC @DmitriySalnikov @dsnopek ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2625620990/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2626236554","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102206#issuecomment-2626236554","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102206","id":2626236554,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ciTCK","user":{"login":"DmitriySalnikov","id":7782218,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3ODIyMTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7782218?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriySalnikov","html_url":"https://github.com/DmitriySalnikov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriySalnikov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriySalnikov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriySalnikov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriySalnikov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriySalnikov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriySalnikov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriySalnikov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriySalnikov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DmitriySalnikov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-31T03:46:13Z","updated_at":"2025-01-31T04:26:57Z","body":"As far as I remember, it's actually more of a warning than an error.\n\nWhen temp files are created, so as not to block compilation and debugging, the path to the `PDB` file inside the `DLL` is replaced with a new one. And since it is impossible to fit a longer string instead of the old one, it is necessary to shorten this name as much as possible.\n\nThe warning that the name has been shortened implies that the full path to the `PDB` is usually written when compiling, not just the name, so it is possible to overwrite the updated name without shortening it.\n\nPossible solutions to the shortening warning:\n* Delete the warning print\n* Print a warning in `--verbose` mode only\n* Build a library with a flag to write the full path to the `PDB` (If it's even possible after [this PR](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/pull/121297))\n\nPossible solutions for too short a path error:\n* Change the format of the temporary file name (for writing and checking existing files) so that a maximum of 10 temporary `PDB` files can be written in a minimal format, for example `~5.pdb`.\n\nAnd as far as I remember, when testing, I created files named `~lib_***.pdb`, which should allow us to write a new string for `rust_ext.pdb`. Possible regression after #99834, but I'm not sure.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2626236554/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698188932","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102206#issuecomment-2698188932","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102206","id":2698188932,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6g0xiE","user":{"login":"lemonlambda","id":55360995,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MzYwOTk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55360995?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemonlambda","html_url":"https://github.com/lemonlambda","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemonlambda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemonlambda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemonlambda/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemonlambda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemonlambda/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemonlambda/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemonlambda/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemonlambda/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lemonlambda/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-04T16:10:44Z","updated_at":"2025-03-04T16:10:44Z","body":"@Per6 Does this cause a crash for you?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2698188932/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2702004836","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102206#issuecomment-2702004836","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102206","id":2702004836,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hDVJk","user":{"login":"Per6","id":76496529,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDk2NTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76496529?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Per6","html_url":"https://github.com/Per6","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Per6/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Per6/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Per6/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Per6/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Per6/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Per6/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Per6/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Per6/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Per6/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-05T20:34:40Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T20:34:40Z","body":"> [@Per6](https://github.com/Per6) Does this cause a crash for you?\n\nno, still perfectly usable.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2702004836/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2890845007","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102206#issuecomment-2890845007","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102206","id":2890845007,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sTstP","user":{"login":"kyambuthia","id":191156343,"node_id":"U_kgDOC2TQdw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191156343?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyambuthia","html_url":"https://github.com/kyambuthia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyambuthia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyambuthia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyambuthia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyambuthia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyambuthia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyambuthia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyambuthia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyambuthia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kyambuthia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-19T12:33:18Z","updated_at":"2025-05-19T12:36:07Z","body":"I get the same Error \n\nWindows 11\nGodot 4.4.1\nrust crate - godot 0.2.4\n\nERROR: The original PDB path size in bytes is too small: 'rust.pdb'. Expected size: 13 or more bytes, but available 8.\n   at: (platform/windows/windows_utils.cpp:180)\nWARNING: Failed to rename the PDB file. The original PDB file for 'C:/Users/kyambuthia/Projects/godot+rust/dino-platformer/../rust/target/debug/rust.dll' will be loaded.\n     at: open_dynamic_library (platform/windows/os_windows.cpp:494)\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2890845007/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3225615272","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102206#issuecomment-3225615272","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102206","id":3225615272,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7AQvuo","user":{"login":"SK83RJOSH","id":1371787,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzE3ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1371787?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH","html_url":"https://github.com/SK83RJOSH","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SK83RJOSH/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-26T20:21:29Z","updated_at":"2025-08-28T03:13:49Z","body":"@DmitriySalnikov\n\n> As far as I remember, it's actually more of a warning than an error.\n\nI wasn't sure at first, as this warning always resulted in PDBs not loading for me, and I felt it would be better to promote it to an error. As it turns out this issue was caused by a regression introduced back in March. More information in the mentioned PR.\n\n> Change the format of the temporary file name (for writing and checking existing files) so that a maximum of 10 temporary PDB files can be written in a minimal format, for example ~5.pdb.\n\nI don't think this would be wise, as directories containing multiple related extensions with similar file names could quickly break down. For example, `godot_ab.pdb`, `godot_bc.pdb` and so on would exhaust the limit fairly quickly. The current scheme mitigates this, albeit at the cost of extra I/O. If one were to rewrite this, I would consider using hashes to reduce the chance of collisions?\n\n> Delete the warning print\n\nI would lean towards this, actually, but the warning helped tracked down the above regression. `--verbose` would have also concealed the regression. Not really sure what the best course of action is.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3225615272/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]